    "MigraineMe clinical summary" to "Resumo clínico MigraineMe",
    "MigraineMe collects various data to help identify your migraine triggers. Here's what we use and why:" to "O MigraineMe recolhe dados para achar os teus fatores. Eis o que usamos e para quê:",
