    "Try the voice input on a real day. The AI is forgiving, you can ramble through \"tired, had wine and pasta, took ibuprofen at 4, felt better by 8\" and it'll log all four." to "Experimenta a voz num dia normal. A IA é tolerante: podes dizer «cansado, vinho e massa, ibuprofeno às 4, melhor às 8» e ela anota as quatro coisas.",
